<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφρέω</span></b>  (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφρέω</span>), poet. impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεφρίομεν</span> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φρίεμεν</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			125
		</span></i>: fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφρήσω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
			156
		</span></i>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέφρησα</span> (infr.), also <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέφρηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: imper. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκφρες</span> prob. for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκφερε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					162
				</span></i>
			:—<i>let out, bring out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ . . οὐκ ἐκφρῶσιν</span> restoredin <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				264
			</span></i> (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μεθῶσιν</span>) from the
			Sch.and <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐριπίδης</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> ll.cc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέφρησα ἐμαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκφρηται: ἐκφέρεται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>go out</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφρησθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					89
				</span></i>
			.</div>
